 "headline": "D155 (3), amending D152 (1): CORRECT ANSWERS DELIVERED BY THE DEADLINE (the cloud's answer if it is on time, else the DEVICE's answer IF IT TOO ARRIVES WITHIN THE DEADLINE, else no answer and the question is a miss; scored on the representation actually sent). On time is reported beside it, not as the headline.",
 "headline_beside_it": "D152 (1): CORRECT ANSWERS DELIVERED AT ANY TIME, which credits the device's answer regardless of when it lands. Reported BESIDE the headline and never mixed with it in one column or one sentence (D155 (3)).",
